# Generated by `npm run qa:search:e2e`, and DERIVED FROM PRODUCTION DATA.
#
# Even with names removed from the sheet, these hold the claimed skills, roles
# and candidate refs of real people in whatever pool the run touched. They are
# reproducible from the harness in minutes, so there is nothing to gain by
# versioning them and a live leak to lose — see
# `scripts/anonymise-match-rationales.ts` for why this repo treats candidate
# data in stored artifacts as a leak rather than a convenience.
#
# `labels.json` is the one you may want to keep: it is YOUR judgements, keyed by
# ref. Un-ignore it deliberately if the team wants a shared ground truth.
last-run.json
labelling-sheet.md
parse-cache.json
labels.json
